# Phase 2 – Backup & Recovery

## Objectives
- Ensure data survivability
- Protect against ransomware and accidental deletion
- Enable recovery without primary account access

## Backup Strategy
- Primary cloud data remains operational
- Automated secondary cloud backups via an independent provider
- Encrypted offline/offsite backups on rotating media
- Regular restore testing

## Key Principle
Cloud services are not backups; independent recovery paths are required.
